          "title": "You'll want to know: el equipaje",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "el equipaje — \"the luggage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El equipaje de mano no puede pesar más de diez kilos. Hand luggage cannot weigh more than ten kilos."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It is singular, like English luggage: mi equipaje."
            }
